<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 16.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.09    2.16</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.63    1.98</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.68    1.01</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.62    0.78</p>
<p> 5   Natl Consol	     9.57    0.94</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.34    1.08</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   9.02    1.81</p>
<p> 8   Indu Property	   8.94    0.95</p>
<p> 9   Equitilink		8.93    0.56</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	 8.74    1.22</p>
<p>11   Schroder Prop	   8.69    2.13</p>
<p>12   Natl In Prop	    8.60    1.02</p>
<p>13   Gen Prop Tr	     8.38    2.40</p>
<p>14   Villa World	     8.33    1.20</p>
<p>15   Gandel Retail Tr	8.31    0.94</p>
<p>16   Colonial Coml	   8.29    2.23</p>
<p>17   Countrywide-PP	  8.19    1.24</p>
<p>18   Ipoh			8.18    2.20</p>
<p>19   Hills Inds		8.14    2.10</p>
<p>20   Westfield Trust	 8.13    2.41</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
